      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This would be particularly nice, not to spite anyone, that's toxic (not like hard limits) but just a selectable physbone limiter that has its configuration file too. Would be a neat little feature maybe so I could go to VRC NYE on 2023 without a motion-sickness inducing framerate. Probably will not be a problem however, but we will see.",
